# Git workflow (commit & integrate)

Use **GitHub Flow**. Integration branch is `main`. Do not land feature work as drive-by commits on `main`.

## Phạm vi ủy quyền

- Task yêu cầu triển khai đến PR/CI hoặc giao Epic end-to-end mặc định cho phép commit, push feature branch và mở PR trong scope đó. Giao Epic end-to-end hoặc yêu cầu integration/merge cũng cho phép coordinator merge sau đủ DoD + CI.
- Yêu cầu chỉ sửa file local, lập kế hoạch hoặc review không mặc định cho phép commit/push/PR/merge. Tôn trọng mọi giới hạn cụ thể trong task; không hỏi lại quyền đã có.
- Tạo cloud resources, deploy production và submit store luôn cần ủy quyền riêng. Status `Sẵn sàng` không tự cấp quyền thực thi task ngoài Epic/Run đã giao.

## Branch

1. Start from the coordinator’s **base / integration commit** (usually latest `main`), not an unrelated dirty tree.
2. Branch name: `<github-user>/<dot>-<scope>-<slug>`  
   Examples: `hangndat/d1-web-clerk`, `hangndat/d1-backend-membership`, `hangndat/d2-ios-wallet`.
3. One Issue (or one clear ownership slice) per branch when practical. No mixing BE+web+iOS on one branch.
4. Workers stay on their task branch; do not push/merge to `main` unless the task explicitly authorizes integration.

## Commit

1. Commit only within the authorization above, when asked by the user/coordinator/task spec, or when the authorized task DoD requires a commit SHA for handoff. Otherwise leave a clean report of uncommitted work.
2. Conventional Commits, Vietnamese or English OK for subject; prefer short why-focused subjects matching repo style:

   ```text
   feat(api): add membership deny-by-default guard
   fix(mobile): isolate identity cache by user
   docs(agents): sync GitHub Project status rules
   ```

3. HEREDOC for `git commit -m`. Never `--no-verify` / force-skip hooks unless the user explicitly orders it.
4. This repo is **not** Seatincorp S10: if the local Jira commit hook blocks, use `JIRA_COMMIT_SKIP=1` for the commit (do **not** invent fake `S10-####` keys).
5. Never commit secrets, `.env`, credentials, or real user data. Do not `git add` unrelated untracked noise (local `mcp.json`, etc.) unless intended.
6. No `commit --amend` / force-push unless the user explicitly requests and safety conditions in the agent commit protocol are met. Preserve commits; rebase/fix via owner, don’t reset away work.

## Pull request & merge

1. Push the feature branch (`-u` when new) only within the authorization above, when the task needs remote CI / review — not “publish production”, but required for DoD when CI must run on GitHub.
2. Open PR with `gh pr create` into `main`. Title/body user-facing bits in **Vietnamese**; keep Issue refs, commands, SHAs intact. Link `Fixes #N` / `Closes #N` when that Issue is the DoD unit. Dùng template `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` (ghi SHA tip branch).
3. After PR is up: Project Status → `Chờ duyệt`; coordinator gốc spawn DoD reviewer theo `orca-agent-routing.mdc` (see `github-project-tracking.mdc` + `orca-agent-routing.mdc`). Spec reviewer phải kèm **exact SHA** đang duyệt.
4. **Coordinator**, when authorized for integration, merges after review pass + CI green (incl. database-isolation when relevant). Workers do not self-merge unless the task explicitly says so.
5. After merge: Project → `Hoàn thành` when full DoD is met; delete remote feature branch if appropriate; report **merge commit SHA** (exact).

### Evidence trên PR / Issue

- Comment nghiệm thu hoặc `docs/reviews/*` phải cite **exact SHA** đã review, reviewer/session, scope, checks, findings/limitations (xem `github-project-tracking.mdc`).
- Push commit hành vi mới sau DoD → **revalidation** trên SHA mới; không “PASS kế thừa”.
- **Thiếu GitHub Review / Approve trên UI không chứng minh thiếu Orca DoD.** Ghi rõ nếu DoD chạy ngoài GitHub (Orca worker) và link/artifact + SHA.

### WIP trước khi mở PR feature mới

Nếu hàng đợi duyệt đầy (ngưỡng trong `github-project-tracking.mdc`): ưu tiên đóng / sửa / merge PR đang mở cùng slice trước khi mở thêm PR feature. PR **fix review** và PR **docs/process** nhỏ vẫn được ưu tiên.

## Anti-patterns

```text
❌ git commit on main for feature/fix work
❌ One PR spanning apps/api + apps/web + apps/mobile
❌ Force-push main / destructive reset to “clean” conflicts
❌ Mark Hoàn thành with only local commits and no PR/CI when DoD requires integration
❌ DoD “PASS” without exact commit SHA / without independent reviewer theo routing rule
❌ Treat missing GitHub approve as “no review happened” when Orca DoD artifact exists
✅ branch → commit(s) → push → PR → independent review (exact SHA) → CI → coordinator merge
```
